FILES
     /dev/cua0
     /dev/cul0
     /dev/null
     /usr/spool/uucp/LCK..cu[al][0-7]

SEE ALSO
     dn(4), tty(4)

DIAGNOSTICS
     Exit code is zero for normal exit, nonzero (various values)
     otherwise.

BUGS
     Only _M_a_i_l(1) uses syntax anything like the syntax of _c_u.

